# Where the commerce API lives.
#
# Server components fetch this directly. The browser never uses it — client
# requests go to /api/... on this same origin and Next rewrites them, so there
# is no CORS story and no API host baked into the HTML.
#
# Locally: http://localhost:5055. Live: https://hosurbasket.com
API_BASE_URL=https://hosurbasket.com

# Used for canonical URLs, sitemap entries and Open Graph tags.
# Locally: http://localhost:3100. Live: https://hosurbasket.com
SITE_URL=https://hosurbasket.com

# Set to 1 to register the service worker under `npm run dev`, so the Install
# button can be tried locally. Leave unset in production (it is always on there).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PWA_DEV=1
